			<TRAN name="obtre_acnt_002a" title="해외주식CFD 결제통화 변경처리" realdata="0" dessvr="9" >
				<TRBLOCK name="InBlock1" inout="in" _len="426" _ulen="314" >

ACNO^계좌번호^8^0^0^0^0^0^0
